// Local/free-team development builds — see .claude/notes/07-notifications.md
// for the paid-team switch. Push Notifications requires a paid Apple
// Developer Program membership to provision; with a free/personal team,
// Xcode fails to sign a real-device build if the entitlements file
// declares aps-environment at all, regardless of its value — so this
// config points at the entitlements file that omits the key entirely,
// not just at a "development" value.
ENABLE_PUSH = NO
CODE_SIGN_ENTITLEMENTS = BanbeApp/BanbeApp.entitlements
